WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:01.429
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

2
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:05.424
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I <b>always</b> watch TV in the evening.

3
00:00:06.765 --> 00:00:10.031
Do you <b>usually</b> sleep for eight hours?

4
00:00:11.431 --> 00:00:14.172
She <b>sometimes</b> does sport.

5
00:00:15.688 --> 00:00:18.633
He <b>often</b> has lunch at work.

6
00:00:19.858 --> 00:00:23.182
She doesn’t <b>often</b> go to bed late.

7
00:00:24.698 --> 00:00:25.719
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

8
00:00:26.419 --> 00:00:28.868
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> They’re <b>hardly ever</b> late.

9
00:00:30.064 --> 00:00:32.747
He isn’t <b>often</b> stressed.

10
00:00:34.088 --> 00:00:36.771
Are you <b>usually</b> in this classroom?

11
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.541
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

12
00:00:40.182 --> 00:00:43.536
<v><b>Speaker 3:</b></v> I go to Italian classes <b>twice a week</b>.

13
00:00:44.935 --> 00:00:47.181
She doesn’t work <b>every day</b>.